{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123954","id":4675720396,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFrHUzA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123954.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123954","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123954/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123954/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123954/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/13a1d916c9c976932d73280a56c7f0192e56b636","number":123954,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix MenuBar item can't click at top or left edge","user":{"login":"Nichgon","id":10327349,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzI3MzQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10327349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon","html_url":"https://github.com/Nichgon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nichgon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- When **MenuBar** is placed at top or left edge of the screen or container (e.g. use anchor top-left), we can't click **MenuBar** item to open its **PopupMenu** when mouse is at the topmost or leftmost position (`y=0` or `x=0`) especially noticeable when using fullscreen mode or mouse-confined window.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9300a323-3941-48e0-ba2b-ad63c5d8e43b\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/756cd60d-6854-4578-960f-bec9afd345df\r\n\r\n### This PR also fix case like this:\r\n\r\nFor example, we have 2 items, each item width is 50 px\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n- (0, 50) (50, 100)\r\n- We can't click item at `x=0` or `x=50`\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n- [0, 50) [50, 100)\r\n- We can click item at `x=0` or `x=50` to open its **PopupMenu**.\r\n\r\nAnd I believe this is preferred behavior than not be able to click.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- This is my first PR and wrote by myself.\r\n- AI disclosure: AI helped me find the bug.\r\n\r\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32796908/mrp.zip) (Godot 4.7 stable)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":""